            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">INFECTION TIMELINE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">A first-time viral infection, roughly</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"220\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.2)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Hours</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Barriers, innate</text><path d=\"M280 290 L340 290\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"220\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.2)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Days 1-3</text><text x=\"450\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">You feel sick</text><path d=\"M560 290 L620 290\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"620\" y=\"220\" width=\"220\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.2)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Days 5-14</text><text x=\"730\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Adaptive peaks</text><path d=\"M840 290 L900 290\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"900\" y=\"220\" width=\"160\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.2)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"980\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">After</text><text x=\"980\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Memory</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"500\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">SECOND EXPOSURE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"610\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Memory cells respond in days, not weeks</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Often before you notice any symptoms</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Innate responders act first; adaptive specialists arrive later and leave memory behind"
