            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">TURN DOWN THE HEAT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Pick two and start this week</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"170\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">1. Measure your waist</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"300\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"357\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">2. Walk 20-30 minutes most days</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"430\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"487\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">3. Protect a 7-hour sleep window</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"560\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"617\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">4. Book a dental cleaning</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"690\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"747\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">5. Get real help to quit smoking</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Small levers, applied consistently"
